        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "42e682ce-407d-33fb-8f9a-5a088690682c",
                "word": "risiblement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "54ae2336-3bff-3eaf-a1db-e72d8f8e692e",
                        "entry_id": "42e682ce-407d-33fb-8f9a-5a088690682c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière risible."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6761576-2b7f-4d09-a898-7a6b79960526",
                                "sense_id": "54ae2336-3bff-3eaf-a1db-e72d8f8e692e",
                                "text": "D'abord leurs escoffions ont volé par la place, Et, laissant voir à nu deux têtes sans cheveux, Ont rendu le combat risiblement affreux,"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b06369c3-c1e3-4e2d-9e37-7fab53117ec6",
                        "source_entry_id": "42e682ce-407d-33fb-8f9a-5a088690682c",
                        "source_sense_id": "54ae2336-3bff-3eaf-a1db-e72d8f8e692e",
                        "target_lang_word": "funnily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "funnily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d4249f0-f143-3b5f-b102-a20a26c9398c",
                                        "entry_id": "6bfd99d0-5b93-3e18-a630-320c2b753707",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a funny or amusing manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae15ac76-e513-45d5-a28f-007a506d4e0d",
                                                "sense_id": "1d4249f0-f143-3b5f-b102-a20a26c9398c",
                                                "text": "In this respect then, Gabriel's repetitive lyric of everyone playing: “games without frontiers and war without tears” was on the one hand quite funnily wrong. 'It's a Knockout' produced tears of laughter. […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36da7407-b709-321e-84ad-4161ad6f548f",
                                        "entry_id": "6bfd99d0-5b93-3e18-a630-320c2b753707",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a strange or unexpected manner, especially of a coincidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea826b68-02ae-4a4f-9233-88f1d371ea10",
                                                "sense_id": "36da7407-b709-321e-84ad-4161ad6f548f",
                                                "text": "Who, Bob? I just ran into him last week, funnily enough."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cae7d012-9888-47b0-b070-4ab99c67ca78",
                                                "sense_id": "36da7407-b709-321e-84ad-4161ad6f548f",
                                                "text": "It hurts to swallow and to eat . . . sometimes, I find myself breathing funnily. The doctors have not found anything, even after the X-ray, but I feel that there is something physically wrong . . ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "68ae5768-0b1a-443f-86a1-c1e080ce2a36",
                        "source_entry_id": "42e682ce-407d-33fb-8f9a-5a088690682c",
                        "source_sense_id": "54ae2336-3bff-3eaf-a1db-e72d8f8e692e",
                        "target_lang_word": "laughably",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "laughably",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a1ad7ab-7c51-34cf-8b0e-f71f41930990",
                                        "entry_id": "64ee0680-bef5-3b2a-8b80-b0d349455eeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a manner that can be laughed at, humorous, in a laughable manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bb5ab0e-9931-427a-91cf-c36c73506565",
                                                "sense_id": "4a1ad7ab-7c51-34cf-8b0e-f71f41930990",
                                                "text": "From Crewe, of course, the ten-coach load of 347/370 tons was a laughably easy proposition for the two engines, between them in effect making up Class \"11\" power, and they fairly romped away with the train."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9fa7bfe3-5b29-466f-9b97-188edd8c0700",
                        "source_entry_id": "42e682ce-407d-33fb-8f9a-5a088690682c",
                        "source_sense_id": "54ae2336-3bff-3eaf-a1db-e72d8f8e692e",
                        "target_lang_word": "ridiculously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ridiculously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb142d6e-4fca-39b0-ad2a-118e11f32d82",
                                        "entry_id": "47cb474b-d30e-3978-9faf-89e21ba52a62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a ridiculous manner. In a way that is funny, embarrassing or extremely implausible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2c4ee00-1d8d-4373-9009-76bcf43331cc",
                                                "sense_id": "eb142d6e-4fca-39b0-ad2a-118e11f32d82",
                                                "text": "From another point of view, it was a place without a soul. The well-to-do had hearts of stone; the rich were brutally bumptious; the Press, the Municipality, all the public men, were ridiculously, vaingloriously self-satisfied."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38cb003a-fe12-4271-886e-3d69c6227449",
                                                "sense_id": "eb142d6e-4fca-39b0-ad2a-118e11f32d82",
                                                "text": "`I was with the ballet back home, but the money was ridiculously low.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "737cd474-4e19-417e-af5c-b5204043ad21",
                                                "sense_id": "eb142d6e-4fca-39b0-ad2a-118e11f32d82",
                                                "text": "It's a shame; not only are nuts quite ridiculously nutritious but, as anyone who's ever shelled out (sorry) for a tiny glass of pistachios in a pub will know, they're a guaranteed crowd-pleaser. But although I happen to have a soft spot for nut roast – an option often preferable to the meat that emerged from the school kitchen – it seems I'm in a cranky minority. A request for recipe recommendations was met with a polite silence on Twitter: vegetarianism, apparently, has moved on a bit. You don't see Yotam Ottolenghi faffing about with nut roasts, do you? But I'm determined to revive the fortunes of this much-maligned classic. After all, Christmas isn't Christmas without a luxury nut selection."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ac58ff9-37e9-379e-9c99-c616cef8d5fd",
                                        "entry_id": "47cb474b-d30e-3978-9faf-89e21ba52a62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "extremely; very"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19ac1850-9e9b-4bfc-a709-d1ec208556e4",
                                                "sense_id": "3ac58ff9-37e9-379e-9c99-c616cef8d5fd",
                                                "text": "Thus, after eighteen months of fantastic and ruinous warfare, the companies had come to their senses and agreed to do what they might have done at the start; the only gainers were the passengers who had been carried at ridiculously uneconomic fares."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a467f68e-1c57-455e-802b-829e662e4277",
                        "source_entry_id": "42e682ce-407d-33fb-8f9a-5a088690682c",
